** sch_path: design/column/sense_amp.sch

* latch SA: SAE low = isolation PMOS pass bit lines to OUT/OUTB, SAE high = latch

.subckt sense_amp SAE BLM BLBM OUT OUTB VDD VSS
*.ipin SAE
*.iopin BLM
*.iopin BLBM
*.iopin OUT
*.iopin OUTB
*.iopin VDD
*.iopin VSS
XMPI0 OUT SAE BLM VDD sg13_lv_pmos w=2.0u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMPI1 OUTB SAE BLBM VDD sg13_lv_pmos w=2.0u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMPL0 OUT OUTB VDD VDD sg13_lv_pmos w=1.0u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMPL1 OUTB OUT VDD VDD sg13_lv_pmos w=1.0u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNL0 OUT OUTB TAIL VSS sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNL1 OUTB OUT TAIL VSS sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
XMNT TAIL SAE VSS VSS sg13_lv_nmos w=2.0u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1
.ends
